## 3. **Pull Request-Specific Filters**

### Review Status Filters
```
state:open is:pr review:none              # Not reviewed yet
state:open is:pr review:required          # Requires review
state:open is:pr review:approved          # Approved
state:open is:pr review:changes_requested # Changes requested
state:open is:pr reviewed-by:octocat      # Reviewed by someone
state:open is:pr review-requested:octocat # Awaiting review from someone
state:open is:pr user-review-requested:@me # Awaiting your review
state:open is:pr team-review-requested:github/docs # Team review requested
```

### Draft & Status Filters
```
is:draft                  # Draft PRs
is:merged                 # Merged PRs
is:unmerged              # Unmerged PRs
status:success           # All status checks passing
status:failure           # At least one failing check
status:pending           # No status or pending status
linked:issue             # Linked to an issue
```

