## 4. **Issue-Specific Filters**

```
linked:pr                              # Linked to a PR
is:closed reason:completed             # Closed as completed
is:closed reason:"not planned"         # Closed as not planned
type:"Bug"                             # By issue type
field.priority:high                    # By issue field values
has:label                              # Has any label
no:project                             # Missing a project
```

